      "task_id" : "dtask:0028c5df24ae2721a0451fde01a4e2afcc2146542dc1f50d",
      "text" : "Lisbon in May is usually mild to warm: **21–23°C during the day and 14–15°C at night**, with plenty of sunshine and occasional rain. These are [historical averages](https://en.climate-data.org/europe/portugal/lisbon/lisbon-3308/t/may-5/), not a forecast for 12–14 May.\n\nPack light layers, a jacket for evenings, sunscreen and a compact umbrella. @crew-test, outdoor activities look sensible, with an indoor backup for showers.",
